license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/junkka/swehist"
abstract: >-
  Swedish historical administrative boundaries, hierarchies and matching
  tools for 11 administrative types (parishes, counties, municipalities,
  pastorships, deaneries, dioceses, hundreds, magistrates courts, district
  courts, courts of appeal, bailiwicks), 1600-1990, based on data from
  Riksarkivet (Swedish National Archives).
keywords:
  - historical GIS
  - Sweden
  - administrative boundaries
  - parishes
  - historical demography
  - R
